<title>SWITZERLAND: Roche sees higher '96 profit, good H2.</title>
<headline>Roche sees higher '96 profit, good H2.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss pharmaceuticals group Roche Holding AG said it expected continued positive sales in local currencies in the second half of 1996 and restated that it still sees a further rise in net profit for the full year.</p>
</text>
